      "name": "Nike Varsity Elite Backpack - Adult",
      "description": "<p>Built to support you on your fitness journey, the Nike Varsity Elite Backpack can hold anything from your water bottle to recovery tools and sneakers. The top zippered plush lined pocket of this backpack keeps your tech and essentials secure, while the ventilated bottom zippered pocket ensures your wet clothes or shoes stay separated from the rest of your belongings. The Air Max shoulder straps let you carry this backpack around in absolute comfort. Stash your training gear in style with the Nike Varsity Elite Backpack.</p> <ul> <li>Expandable gusseted side pocket provides easy access to drinks.</li> <li>Spot clean.</li> <li>Dimensions: 12\" W x 19\" H x 9\" D.</li> <li>100% polyester. </li> </ul>",
